<%- include('../partials/tw-head') -%>
<body class="fbi-site flex min-h-full flex-col bg-slate-50 text-slate-800 antialiased">
<%- include('../partials/tw-header') -%>
<main class="flex-1">
  <%- include('../partials/tw-hero-premium', {
    heroVariant: 'slate',
    heroBadge: PRODUCTS.sentinel.tag,
    heroStatus: PRODUCTS.sentinel.statusBadge,
    heroEyebrow: 'Local-first evidence intelligence',
    heroTitle: PRODUCTS.sentinel.headline,
    heroLead: PRODUCTS.sentinel.subhead,
    heroLeadExtra: 'Organize complex evidence with structure and traceability. Built for investigative and review workflows. Your evidence stays under your control.',
    heroSplit: true,
    heroMockup: 'sentinel',
    heroActionsHtml: '<a href="#sentinel-development" class="inline-flex rounded-full bg-faithGold px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition duration-280 ease-fbi-out hover:bg-amber-600 focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-amber-300 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-slate-900">Development status</a><a href="compare.html" class="inline-flex rounded-full border border-slate-600 px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition duration-280 ease-fbi-out hover:border-slate-500 hover:bg-white/5 focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-white/40">Compare products</a><a href="products.html" class="inline-flex rounded-full border border-slate-600 px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition duration-280 ease-fbi-out hover:border-slate-500 hover:bg-white/5 focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-white/40">All products</a>'
  }) -%>

  <section class="fbi-feature-band fbi-grid-bg">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="fbi-split-section">
        <div class="max-w-xl">
          <p class="fbi-kicker text-faithGold">Human review</p>
          <h2 class="fbi-section-title mt-3">Evidence intelligence for human review</h2>
          <p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600">Sentinel helps you ingest, organize, connect, review, summarize, visualize, and export large collections of evidence in a structured, professional way. It supports legal workflows, investigations, compliance review, forensics, journalism, HR matters, disputes, medical documentation review, advocacy, attorney preparation, and personal evidence organization.</p>
          <p class="mt-4 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">The purpose is to organize information for <strong class="text-navy">human review</strong>, not to replace judgment, counsel, or professional responsibility.</p>
        </div>
        <%- include('../partials/tw-tech-diagram', {
          diagramTitle: 'Evidence stays local',
          diagramLead: 'Ingest and structure on your machine. Steward assists with timelines and patterns from material you supplied.'
        }) %>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-y border-slate-200 bg-white py-16">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="text-center text-2xl font-bold text-navy sm:text-3xl">Core philosophy</h2>
      <ul class="mx-auto mt-10 grid max-w-4xl gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
        <li class="fbi-card fbi-card--flat rounded-2xl px-4 py-3.5 text-sm text-slate-700">Local-first architecture</li>
        <li class="fbi-card fbi-card--flat rounded-2xl px-4 py-3.5 text-sm text-slate-700">Privacy-focused workflows</li>
        <li class="fbi-card fbi-card--flat rounded-2xl px-4 py-3.5 text-sm text-slate-700">User-controlled data</li>
        <li class="fbi-card fbi-card--flat rounded-2xl px-4 py-3.5 text-sm text-slate-700">Structured evidence organization</li>
        <li class="fbi-card fbi-card--flat rounded-2xl px-4 py-3.5 text-sm text-slate-700">Traceable workflows</li>
        <li class="fbi-card fbi-card--flat rounded-2xl px-4 py-3.5 text-sm text-slate-700">Professional operational tooling</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-navy">Sentinel is</h2>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-faithGold"></span>A standalone evidence organization application</li>
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-faithGold"></span>An evidence intelligence workspace</li>
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-faithGold"></span>A chronology and relationship-mapping system</li>
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-faithGold"></span>An operational review environment</li>
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-faithGold"></span>A structured export and reporting workspace</li>
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-faithGold"></span>A professional evidence preparation system</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-navy">Sentinel is not</h2>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-slate-400"></span>A law firm or legal advice</li>
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-slate-400"></span>An attorney replacement or “AI lawyer”</li>
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-slate-400"></span>A predictive legal engine</li>
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-slate-400"></span>A cloud surveillance system</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="sentinel-capabilities" class="scroll-mt-28 border-y border-slate-200 bg-slate-50/50 py-16">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="text-center text-2xl font-bold text-navy">Core capabilities</h2>
      <ul class="mt-8 space-y-3 text-slate-600">
        <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-faithGold"></span>Evidence ingestion and preservation</li>
        <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-faithGold"></span>Timeline generation and chronology analysis</li>
        <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-faithGold"></span>Relationship mapping and recurring-pattern identification</li>
        <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-faithGold"></span>Document categorization and authority/reference organization</li>
        <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-faithGold"></span>Evidence summaries and visualization workflows</li>
        <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-faithGold"></span>Structured exports, printable reports, and attorney-review packets</li>
        <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-faithGold"></span>Evidence-linked reporting and audit-friendly workflows</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="mt-8 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">Imports and organization can include PDFs, images and screenshots, spreadsheets, exported message logs, research materials, audio and video references, documents, web references, and authority materials, with relationships preserved between evidence, events, entities, and chronology where possible.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy"><%= SITE.steward.name %> in Sentinel</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-navy"><%= SITE.steward.name %></strong> is the local, user-trainable guidance layer shared across Faith Based Innovations products. In Sentinel, Steward acts as an evidence organization assistant and investigative workflow layer on your machine.</p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Steward can help organize evidence, surface related information, support timeline construction, highlight recurring patterns, locate supporting material, assist with summaries, and help prepare structured review materials, always oriented to what you supplied, for your review. It learns from your corrections, naming patterns, and case-specific rules you approve.</p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-sm font-semibold text-navy"><%= SITE.steward.trainabilityLine %></p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-slate-500">Steward does not provide legal advice, guaranteed outcomes, automated legal conclusions, court predictions, or attorney replacement. Sentinel organizes information; professionals and users retain responsibility for conclusions and decisions.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="border-y border-slate-200 bg-white py-16">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="text-center text-2xl font-bold text-navy">Exports and review materials</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-center text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Sentinel is built to produce professional, modern, organized outputs: attorney-review summaries, evidence summaries, timeline packets, structured reports, printable exports, and operational review materials, with Faith Based Innovations branding integrated subtly and professionally where appropriate.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="sentinel-development" class="scroll-mt-28 mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy">Development status</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed"><%= PRODUCTS.sentinel.development.summary %></p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Current stage: <strong class="text-navy"><%= PRODUCTS.sentinel.development.stage %></strong> (as of <time datetime="2026-05-19"><%= PRODUCTS.sentinel.development.asOf %></time>). Active systems integration, operational workflow construction, and foundational export and report generation are underway.</p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Sentinel is not positioned as production complete, enterprise released, attorney-certified, legally authoritative, or feature finalized. The application is actively evolving.</p>
    <h3 class="mt-10 text-lg font-semibold text-navy">Systems in active development</h3>
    <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-600">
      <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-faithGold"></span>Evidence ingestion pipelines and structured indexing</li>
      <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-faithGold"></span>Timeline generation and relationship mapping</li>
      <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-faithGold"></span>Local-first storage and persistent case organization</li>
      <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-faithGold"></span><%= SITE.steward.name %> contextual workflow integration</li>
      <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-faithGold"></span>Structured export, visualization, and attorney-review packet workflows</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="mt-8 text-sm text-slate-500">Priorities: reliability, workflow cohesion, local-first architecture, export quality, traceability, and operational usability across investigative domains.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="fbi-feature-band fbi-feature-band--navy py-14 text-white">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 text-center sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">Modular software ecosystem</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-slate-300 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-white">Sentinel</strong> is a standalone evidence application. <strong class="text-white">CFO</strong>, <strong class="text-white">Eden</strong>, and <strong class="text-white">Ledger</strong> are separate focused applications. <%= SITE.steward.name %> is the shared local, user-trainable guidance layer that connects them through consistent, permission-aware workflows.</p>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-400"><%= SITE.steward.trainabilityLine %></p>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3">
        <a href="product-cfo.html" class="rounded-lg border border-slate-600 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold hover:bg-white/10">CFO</a>
        <a href="product-eden.html" class="rounded-lg border border-slate-600 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold hover:bg-white/10">Eden</a>
        <a href="product-ledger.html" class="rounded-lg border border-slate-600 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold hover:bg-white/10">Ledger</a>
        <a href="compare.html" class="rounded-lg bg-faithGold px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-navy hover:bg-amber-500">Compare all</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <%- include('../partials/tw-sentinel-availability') %>
</main>
<%- include('../partials/tw-footer') %>
<%- include('../partials/tw-scripts') %>
</body>
</html>
